<PageTitle>Textarea — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Textarea</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    The same frame as Input, with rows instead of a height — and the same reason
    <code>--control-text</code> exists, because shadcn writes the size literally.
</p>

