<h2 class="doc-h2">Button</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    The composer shape. The frame carries the focus ring rather than the textarea, because
    <code>:focus-within</code> is what makes a composite control look focused.
</p>
<Example Source="TextareaButton.razor"><TextareaButton /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">RTL</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    Nothing to set. A textarea takes its direction from the document, and the resize handle moves
    to the other corner on its own.
</p>
<Example Source="TextareaRtl.razor"><TextareaRtl /></Example>
